$MDESC::Type = "CTF Community Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Dramicus" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Dry" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Description:<f0>  The barren world of Dramicus is a dry flatlifeless desert. The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have each built new bases that incorporate 'older than time' alien technology. There are also TWO objectives - One to the NE and the other to the SW. There is also a few 'easter eggs' in this map! Base Defense is preset, but not perfect! If you fail to defend your base - you WILL loose this match!" @

"\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Each team must grab the other's flag and bring it back to your base to capture it for <f1>1 point<f4>." @
"\nThe first team to reach <f1>15 points<f4> shall be the victor!" @

"\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> [KmA] Jumper <P> aka -|DA|- Jumper" @

"\n\n\n<f1>Version.<f0> 1.0";
